<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Hi&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: yellow; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">[Insert Name]</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 12pt;">,</span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:
&quot;Times New Roman&quot;"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I’d like to invite you to host a Heroes Saving Lives blood
drive – a partnership opportunity with fellow military, veteran and service
groups across the country. Our nation’s heroes and our everyday community
heroes – our blood donors, joining together in the mission to help save lives. <o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Your support as a blood program partner is needed!<span style="mso-spacerun:yes">&nbsp; </span>Every day there are more than 12,000 blood
donations needed for patients. The blood you collect can help save lives down
the street or across the country – <b>Red Cross blood products are di<span style="color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;background:white">stributed to 2,500
hospitals and transfusion centers across the country, including patients at
many U.S. Department of Veterans Affairs medical centers.</span></b><span style="mso-no-proof:yes"> <o:p></o:p></span></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><b><span style="color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;background:white"><br></span></b></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-no-proof:yes">Your support as a partner will not go
unnoticed. Your efforts will directly impact the blood supply and you’ll
receive a certificate of appreciation as a Heroes Saving Lives participant.</span><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;line-height:107%;font-family:
&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-no-proof:yes"><br></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">I look forward to
sharing all the details with you about the Heroes Saving Lives opportunity.
When is the best time we can connect? <o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif">Thank you,<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom:0in;line-height:normal"><span style="font-size:12.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>

